  {
   "etapa": "explicar",
   "piezas": [
    {
     "tipo": "explicacion",
     "titulo": "Questions",
     "texto": [
      "To report a question, use **-냐고 물었어요** (asked if…): 가다 → **가냐고** (asked if (he/she) goes), 있다 → **있냐고** (asked if there is or if (he/she) has), 먹다 → **먹냐고** (asked if (he/she) eats).",
      "어디 **가냐고** 물었어요 = asked where (he/she) was going."
     ],
     "tutora": ""
    },
    {
     "tipo": "explicacion",
     "titulo": "Orders and suggestions",
     "texto": [
      "**-(으)라고 했어요** reports an order (said to do something). **-자고 했어요** reports a suggestion (suggested that we do something).",
      "기다리**라고** 했어요 = said to wait. 같이 가**자고** 했어요 = suggested that we go together."
     ],
     "tutora": ""
    },
